sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Terminal as Blazor IDScanner Page
    participant API as scan.php
    participant DB as MariaDB Database

    User->>Terminal: Taps NFC Card
    Terminal->>API: HTTP POST with NFC Tag ID
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE NfcTagId = ?
    DB-->>API: Return User Record
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM campussettings WHERE EducationalLevel = ?
    DB-->>API: Return Attendance Rules
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM attendancelogs WHERE UserId = ? AND LogDate = ? ORDER BY Id DESC LIMIT 1
    DB-->>API: Return Last Log for Today
    API->>API: Determine if next action is ENTRY or EXIT
    API->>DB: INSERT (for ENTRY) or UPDATE (for EXIT) attendancelogs table
    DB-->>API: Confirm Transaction
    API-->>Terminal: Return JSON Response (Success, User Info, Message)
    Terminal-->>User: Display "Welcome" or "Goodbye" message
